Wi-Fi and Bluetooth
-------------------

When the optional Wi-Fi/Bluetooth configuration is selected, an ESP32-C6 module provides Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity to the ESP32-P4 through SDIO. 

The ESP32-C6 operates as a coprocessor.

Espressif's official ESP-Hosted Wi-Fi and Bluetooth firmware will be flashed at the factory before shipping.

